  nonce: 1b52  # 1b52
  message: "Fixed in PR #3871 (367693c99b). Python analyzer now emits every FunctionDef/AsyncFunctionDef at any nesting depth as a Symbol with a qualified name (outer.inner / outermost.middle.inner), and bare-name calls inside the outer body resolve through a per-parent inner_scope map before falling through to module scope (Python LEGB). End-to-end on sketch.py's _collect_important_files validation case: 0 → 4 inner Symbols, 0 → 4 outer-to-inner calls edges. Five new tests + four updated tests pin the invariant. WI-hahor (the isbefore-blocker) covered as a downstream consumer surface."  # 1b52
